            rationale: "There is a new receiver-owned need: develop rough-transport cart designs using a method another lab published, with a measurable acceptance bar. This is mission work and needs one accountable owner. The retained method selection is only evidence; it is not an installed capability. The Lab lead is the only active role, and its charter already covers owning the lab and running rough-transport deliveries. Assigning the requirement there gives it one accountable owner without creating a role. A new role is not justified: there is no distinct continuing work or reason for separate execution yet. No capability is installed to attach. A capability request is not possible because the evidence reference is an internal genesis reference, not a public URL usable as an observed source. No specialists are known.",
